===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|as|as, als(a), alswa}}, from {{inh|en|ang|eallswā||just so; as}}, thus representing a reduced form of {{m|en|also}}. Compare {{cog|nds-de|as}}, {{cog|de|als}}, {{cog|nl|als}}.

